pkimaster (0.2.0-1) trixie; urgency=medium

  * Package the web-managed PKI console as a hardened HTTPS systemd service.
  * Use Debian Python dependencies without an installation-time pip download.
  * Preserve CA keys, administrator accounts and audit data across upgrades.

